      "content": "5. Factors Affecting Industrial Location"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8xobk92",
      "content": "• Availability of raw materials."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8l7kime",
      "content": "• Availability of labour."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o7u8xhd",
      "content": "• Availability of power supply."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "279bdmq",
      "content": "• Transportation facilities."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kzgsbup",
      "content": "• Market availability."
    },
    {
      "id": "d9n1c0a",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Industrial Policies in India"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fyzrmp2",
      "content": "• Industrial Policy Resolution 1948 – first industrial policy of India."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a8st5zm",
      "content": "• Industrial Policy Resolution 1956 – emphasized public sector development."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ed9hdfk",
      "content": "• New Industrial Policy 1991 – liberalization, privatization and globalization."
    },
    {
